text: {:exit 0, :out "{\"lifecycle\":{\"effectiveLaunch\":{\"browserLaunched\":true,\"engine\":\"chrome\",\"launchHash\":12115916777079691000},\"launched\":false,\"relaunchedBrowser\":false,\"restartedBackground\":false,\"restoreStatus\":\"not_configured\",\"reused\":true,\"saveStatus\":\"not_attempted\"},\"origin\":\"https://ora-ventures.com/en/\",\"result\":\"Ora\\nAbout\\nWork\\nGrowth\\nProcess\\nClients\\nContact\\nEN\\nFR\\nMake\\nMake\\nyour ad\\nhiring\\n spend\\nprocess\\nfeel like 2030\\nfeel like 2030\\n\\nTailor-built AI platforms that bring you more sales & leaner operations.\\n\\nGET STARTED →\\nABOUT ORA\\nWe build the agentic SMB.\\nWe build the agentic SMB.\\n\\nOra Ventures partners with small and mid-size businesses to design, build, and deploy custom technology that drives more revenue — from AI-powered sales engines to streamlined operations platforms.\\n\\nWe don’t sell subscriptions. We build systems you own, on your infrastructure, tailored to your business model. Strategy, technology, and creative — all in one engagement.\\n\\n◆\\nProcess Audit\\n\\nWe map your workflows and find where AI creates the most value.\\n\\n◆\\nMarket Strategy\\n\\nWe build data-driven playbooks for your competitive landscape.\\n\\n◆\\nCustom Technology\\n\\nCRMs, ERPs, and AI tools built for your business — deployed in days.\\n\\nGet your custom infrastructure with your SMB budget.\\n01. Map the potential\\n02. Implemented in days, not months\\nPROCESS AUDIT\\nCrystal Clear Potential\\nCrystal Clear Potential\\n\\nWe interview your team. We trace your workflows. We map every tool, handoff, and bottleneck. What you get: a forensic report that shows exactly where AI-native processes will multiply your output — and what to do first.\\n\\nINFRASTRUCTURE\\nReady to Implement\\nReady to Implement\\n\\nNo cloud dependency. No vendor lock-in. We build systems that run on your infrastructure — from your sales engine to your internal ops. You deploy on day one, not day ninety.\\n\\nExpand your market without stretching thin.\\n01. 360 Market Understanding\\n02. On-brand Playbook\\nMARKET STRATEGY\\nKnow Your Market, Own Your Growth\\nKnow Your Market, Own Your Growth\\n\\nWe map your competitors, your ad channels, and your pricing gaps with a strategy built from live market data. Understand your competitors' playbooks with our custom reports and have your own ready to run.\\n\\nCUSTOM PLAYBOOKS\\nAI-native growth strategies\\nAI-native growth strategies\\n\\nPlaybooks built on expertise, brands built with creative human talent, launched and ran with generative AI. We provide you with on-brand assets that you can use today, complete with data analytics that let you stay ahead of the market.\\n\\nYou can have it today.\\n01. DIRECT AUDIT\\nWe learn your business\\n\\nWe interview. We observe. We map every tool, handoff, and cost center. You get a 360° understanding of your business and its growth potential.\\n\\n02. FULL STRATEGY\\nWe build your playbook\\n\\nMarket positioning. Ad channels. Competitor gaps. Pricing. Brand assets. Ads creative. Content strategy. A playbook built with expertise and ready to deploy.\\n\\n03. WITH TECH YOU OWN\\nYou get tools built for you\\n\\nMake tech uniquely yours. Use CRMs, ERPs, and marketing platforms that reflect your business model and your brand.\\n\\nRESULTS\\nThe results our clients got can be yours too.\\n3x\\nMORE LEADS\\n0\\nCLOUD BILLS\\n14\\nDAYS LIVE\\n2x\\nCONVERSION\\nMORE QUALIFIED LEADS\\nA beauty brand was spending on ads that reached everyone and converted no one.\\n\\nA white-labelled cosmetics brand couldn’t increase their ad spend because their sales reps were drowning in unqualified leads. We built an AI chatbot that qualified leads for them, upsold on their offerings, and advised on which ones to pursue first.\\nWe helped them slash their lead treatment time by 80% and triple the number of qualified leads their sales team could focus on.\\n\\nCOSMETICS\\nLEAD QUALIFICATION\\nCLOUD BILLS\\nA solar installer was running on empty spreadsheets, we made them a custom CRM that had leads already scheduled without their input.\\n\\nWe rehauled their branding assets, built high-converting ad creatives and landing pages, a conversational intelli" <> ...}

=> :ok

